 to the left.\n\n```.\n    360640056.\n  + 898574707.\n  ============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 7 = 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 7 = 7\\)  .\n   Write down **7**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 4 = 4\\)  .\n   Write down **4**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 5 = 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 8 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 8 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 8 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1**.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\)  .\n    Write down **1**.\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:.\n\n# Answer:.\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1359214763'}
