 Write down **9**.\n\n9. **Hundred millions place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 1 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    The carried-over **1** is written down.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n```.\n    967,099,234.\n  + 125,931,556.\n  ==============.\n  1,093,030,790.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1033030790'}
