.\n    436382766.\n  + 527945349.\n  ============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 9 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 3 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 5 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 4 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 7 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 5 = 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 2 = 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '964328105'}
