it by digit, starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\n```.\n    485,678,803.\n  + 629,635,014.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 4 = 7\\).\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 1 = 1\\).\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 0 = 8\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 5 = 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 3 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 16\\)  .\n   Write down **6** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\).\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 6 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\).\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:.\n\n# Answer:.\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1115313317'}
