(= 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 7 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n8. **Hundred millions place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 9 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n9. **Billions place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\)  .\n   Write down **1**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n```.\n    121,876,445.\n+   967,866,178.\n--------------.\n  1,089,742,623.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1089742923'}
