s add the two numbers digit by digit, starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\n```.\n    667,689,171.\n  + 440,635,608.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 8 = 9\\).\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 0 = 7\\).\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 6 = 7\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 5 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n5. **Ten thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 3 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n6. **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 6 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\).\n\n8. **Ten millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 4 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n9. **Hundred millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 11\\)  .\n   Write down **11**.\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:.\n\n# Answer:.\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1108334779'}
